// #67, #73: a SYN in a synchronized state, here the SYN-ACK sent again
// because our ACK was lost, gets a challenge ACK (RFC 5961 §4); a second
// one within 500 ms does not (tcp_oow_rate_limited, tcp_invalid_ratelimit).
0      connect 192.0.2.2:80
+0     > S 0:0(0) <mss 1460,sackOK,nop,nop,TS val ? ecr 0,nop,wscale 8,eol>
+0.01  < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535

+0.1   < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1
+0.1   < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0.5   < S. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 4000 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 1
+0     state ESTABLISHED
